==Format==
* '''Play-In Stage''': July ''29<sup>th</sup>, 2026''
** Double Elimination qualifier bracket
** All matches are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
** {{Bgcolortext|up|Top 2 teams}} qualify to '''Main Stage'''
* '''Main Stage''': July ''30<sup>th</sup>'' - August ''1<sup>st</sup>, 2026''
** Double Elimination bracket
** All matches ''(excl. UB Quarterfinals, UB Semifinals & Grand-Final)'' are {{Abbr/Bo5}}
** UB Quarterfinals, UB Semifinals is {{Abbr/Bo3}}
** Grand Final is {{Abbr/Bo7}}

